# Growth Capital Origination Engine
#
# This project intentionally requires zero environment variables.
#
# There are no API keys, no bearer tokens, no database URLs, and no
# authentication credentials anywhere in this application. The site is a
# fully static export. Every company record, score, and document is committed
# to the repository as static data and is served without any runtime lookup.
#
# This file exists only to document that absence. It deliberately contains
# comments and no variable assignments. If you clone this repository you do
# not need to copy this file, rename it, or fill anything in.
#
# Expected count of required variables: 0
